        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imp 32:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amaf 3:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo umbi citika wa luko lwakwa Manase, abena Rubeni na bena Gadi bapeelwe iciputulwa cimbi kwishilya lya Yordani ku kabanga ngefyo Mose umubomfi wakwa Yawe abapeele kukuba icakaniko ca cishilano cabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abashilile icalo ukufuma ku Aroeli icaba mu lulamba lwa mukonko wa Alinoni, no musumba pakati nankati ka mukonko no kubikako, ne calo conse icabatama ica Medeba no kuya shinta na ku Diboni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili abashilile ne misumba yonse iyo Sihoni imfumu ya bena Amoli, uwali imfumu ya mu Heshiboni ukuya fikafye na ku mupaka wa bena Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo kuli ici cine calo, kwalundilwe na Gileadi ne calo ca bena Geshuri na bena Maakati, bonse aba ku lupili lwa Hemoni, ne calo ca Bashani ukushinta na ku Saleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwalundilweko icalo conse ica mfumu Ogi ku Bashani, uwaleteeka mu Ashitaroti na mu Edelei, kabili ewashelepofye ku bena Refaimu. Pantu Mose alibacimfishe bonse no kupoka icalo cabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo abena Israeli tabafulumwinemo abena Geshuri na bena Maakati, bena batwalililafye ukulaikala pamo na bena Israeli ukufika no bushiku bwa lelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
