            "sid": "JOS 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifi efyo Mose ayakenye icalo kuli citika wa luko lwakwa Manase, nabo ecali icakaniko ca citika wa bana bakwa Manase umwabelele indupwa shabo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icalo catendekelefye ukufuma ku Manaimu ukubikako icitungu conse ica Bashani ne calo conse icakwa Ogi imfumu ya ku Bashani, ne misumba iyakwa Yairi mu Bashani mwine amakumi mutanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "elyo citika wa calo ca Gileadi, Ashitaroti elyo na Edelei, imisumba yakwa Ogi imfumu ya mu Bashani. Ici e calo capeelwe kuli bamwana Makiri, uwali umwana mwaume wakwa Manase. Capeelwe kuli citika wa bamwana Makiri, umwabelele indupwa shabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
