        {
          "text": "Lelo uluko lwa bena Levi, Mose talupeeleko icakaniko ca cishilano nakalya, pantu Yawe, Lesa wa bena Israeli, ena e cishilano cabo, pamo ngefyo Lesa umwine abalaile.",
